  dialogueNodes:
  - id: Start
    text: 'Have you ever noticed your <sprite name="mr"> is also valid? If not, don''t
      worry. '
    nextNodeIds:
    - 1
    choiceText: []
    choiceEventKeys: []
  - id: 1
    text: 'I will teach you how to use the defense ability. Remember the defense
      ability is bound to the weapon type. '
    nextNodeIds:
    - 2
    choiceText: []
    choiceEventKeys: []
  - id: 2
    text: 'When you equip a gun and in the state of moving, press <sprite name=mr>
      can let you dash on the original direction. '
    nextNodeIds:
    - 3
    choiceText: []
    choiceEventKeys: []
  - id: 3
    text: While dashing, you are invulnerable and can dodge through enemy attacks!
    nextNodeIds:
    - 4
    choiceText: []
    choiceEventKeys: []
  - id: 4
    text: Press <sprite name="1"> to go back to your gun and try it out, then come
      back to me when you're ready.
    nextNodeIds:
    - null
    choiceText: []
    choiceEventKeys: []
